{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00676",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.3,
      "end_seconds": 11.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "Hello. Er, it's a bit embarrassing, so it is. There's been blood on the toilet paper."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.77,
      "end_seconds": 21.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.43,
      "text": "You're not the first, and you're right to come. How long has that been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.65,
      "end_seconds": 33.89,
      "duration_seconds": 10.24,
      "text": "About a week, I'd say. Every time I go, nearly. Bright red, on the paper. Not in the pan, mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.9,
      "end_seconds": 44.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "And is it mixed in with the stool, or only on the paper?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.6,
      "end_seconds": 51.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Just on the paper, after I wipe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.83,
      "end_seconds": 57.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Any pain when you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.98,
      "end_seconds": 67.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "A bit of a sting, yes. And an itch around there, which is awful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.42,
      "end_seconds": 73.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Are you constipated, or straining?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.8,
      "end_seconds": 84.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "I do strain, if I'm honest. I have the sort of stools that don't want to leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.01,
      "end_seconds": 96.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "Any change in how often you go, or in the stool, black, loose, or anything unusual?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.35,
      "end_seconds": 104.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "No, it's much the same as always, hard and slow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.62,
      "end_seconds": 109.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "What's your diet like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.11,
      "end_seconds": 117.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Terrible. Takeaways, mostly. Hardly any veg. My mother would be mortified."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.56,
      "end_seconds": 124.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "And what do you do for work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.96,
      "end_seconds": 135.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "I'm at a desk all day, I do the accounts for a haulage firm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.62,
      "end_seconds": 139.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Any past operations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.92,
      "end_seconds": 149.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "A hernia repair, years ago, on the right. Ten years, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.7,
      "end_seconds": 157.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Let me check your pulse and pressure first. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.49,
      "end_seconds": 161.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.69,
      "end_seconds": 179.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Pulse 70, blood pressure 130 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.26,
      "end_seconds": 184.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Is that good? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.26,
      "end_seconds": 199.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.17,
      "text": "Good. Now, from what you describe, bright red blood only on the paper, a sting and itch, and hard stools, this sounds like haemorrhoids, piles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.43,
      "end_seconds": 205.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Piles! My granda had those. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.63,
      "end_seconds": 221.23,
      "duration_seconds": 13.6,
      "text": "Very common. But at your age, I'd like to be sure, so I'd like to arrange a proctoscopy, a short look inside with a small tube."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.19,
      "end_seconds": 228.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Oh, God. Is that sore? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.49,
      "end_seconds": 239.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.85,
      "text": "It's uncomfortable, not painful, and it takes a minute. The nurse will book you in this week. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.64,
      "end_seconds": 245.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Right. Right, if I must. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.22,
      "end_seconds": 259.26,
      "duration_seconds": 10.04,
      "text": "In the meantime, have more fibre, fruit and veg, and drink lots of water, so the stools soften."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.46,
      "end_seconds": 266.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "I can do an apple. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.44,
      "end_seconds": 278.74,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "An apple is a start. Don't strain, and don't sit on the toilet scrolling your phone. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.66,
      "end_seconds": 284.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "How did you know? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.61,
      "end_seconds": 300.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.81,
      "text": "Everyone does it. Come back and see me in two weeks, once you've had the proctoscopy, to go over it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.82,
      "end_seconds": 306.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Two weeks. Thanks, doctor. ~"
    }
  ]
}
